# Compose variables for the LiveKit stack (PRODUCTION ONLY — local dev points at
# the live SFU via backend/.env and runs no LiveKit container).
#
# Leave LIVEKIT_NODE_IP EMPTY. `use_external_ip: true` in infra/livekit.yaml makes
# LiveKit STUN-detect the server's public address by itself, and docker-compose
# passes --node-ip only when this is non-empty. An empty value is the correct,
# maintenance-free setting.
#
# Set it only to pin a specific address on a box with several public IPs. Never
# set it to a private (10.x / 172.x / 192.168.x) address or to a Cloudflare IP:
# it goes straight into the ICE candidates browsers are told to send media to.
#
# Do NOT run infra/set-node-ip.sh here — its Linux branch writes the private IP.
LIVEKIT_NODE_IP=
